sequenceDiagram
    participant GIS as GIS Source
    participant GEO as Geo Pipeline
    participant REG as Registrar
    participant SMT as Sparse Merkle Tree
    participant PROVER as Groth16 Prover
    participant CONTRACT as LandRegistry.sol

    GIS->>GEO: parcel polygon
    GEO->>REG: fine cells (res 12), coarse cells (res 9)
    REG->>SMT: findCell (overlap check)
    SMT-->>REG: no overlap
    REG->>SMT: insertCell for each fine cell
    SMT-->>REG: Merkle witnesses, newRoot
    REG->>PROVER: circuit inputs (cells, salt, witnesses)
    PROVER-->>REG: proof, pubSignals [oldRoot, newRoot, commitment]
    REG->>CONTRACT: registerParcel(proof, pubSignals, coarseCells, uri)
    CONTRACT-->>REG: tx confirmed, tokenId minted, ParcelRegistered event
